        <mxCell id="c230" value="&lt;b&gt;Cascade caveat.&lt;/b&gt; place_photos.place_id, place_hours.place_id and place_reports.place_id declare cascadeOnDelete, enforced by MySQL rather than Eloquent. A database cascade fires no model event, so the application removes photo files explicitly through PhotoStorage at every deletion site. This was a measured defect: 1,803 unreferenced files totalling 4.36 GB before the leak paths were closed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;places.geom is a POINT SRID 4326 carrying a SPATIAL INDEX; boundary_areas.geom is a POLYGON used for point-in-polygon barangay assignment." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1300" y="40" width="420" height="250" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
